# OtherThing Node — Environment Variables
#
# Most configuration is auto-detected. You only need this file
# for optional overrides and development/testing.

# Funder wallet private key (OPTIONAL — only for dev/testing on Sepolia)
# Used to fund test wallets with ETH and OTT tokens
# FUNDER_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# Override Ollama endpoint (OPTIONAL — auto-detected by default)
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434

# Groq API — Whisper transcription (premium feature)
# GROQ_API_KEY=
